# ============================================================================
# Source code: commit ONLY the paper's canonical scripts (see README > Methods).
# Experimental / exploratory scripts are intentionally excluded so that
# `git add -A` stages exactly the paper pipeline. To add a NEW pipeline script,
# whitelist it here.
# ============================================================================
*.py
*.R
*.ipynb
*.sh

